 **Steps:**
-1.  Determine the level of cell $c$, denoted as $L_c$ [S1].
-2.  Identify the coincident face $f'$ corresponding to the input face $f$. If $f$ is the $+x$ face, $f'$ is the $-x$ face of the neighbor [S1].
